WEBVTT

00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:10.100
A candidate who has already transformed education in Macapá.

00:00:10.100 --> 00:00:16.400
Clécio renovated over 80% of the city's public schools, built daycare centers,

00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:22.600
created school councils in every school, and secured regionally sourced meals.

00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:27.400
Clécio changed Macapá. Now he'll transform education in Amapá.
